      <button type="button" id="tgDlBtn" onclick="tgDownloadInvoice()" class="mt-2 w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-gold-500/40 text-gold-400 hover:bg-gold-500 hover:text-black transition-colors text-xs font-extrabold"><i class="fa-solid fa-image mr-1.5"></i>ইনভয়েস ইমেজ ডাউনলোড (PNG)</button>
      <button type="button" onclick="openTrack(state.lastOrder&&state.lastOrder.orderId)" class="mt-2 w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white hover:border-gold-500 transition-colors text-xs font-extrabold"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast mr-1.5 text-gold-400"></i>অর্ডার ট্র্যাক করুন</button>
      <button type="button" onclick="myoFromConfirm()" class="mt-2 w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 text-white hover:border-gold-500 transition-colors text-xs font-extrabold"><i class="fa-solid fa-receipt mr-1.5 text-gold-400"></i>আমার সব অর্ডার দেখুন</button>
